#: ../../source/docs/common-qiotek-zealot.rst:10
#: 66b9b977d9d2445287e11072362aece8
msgid ""
"The QioTek Zealot F427 is an internally vibration dampened autopilot with a "
"protective CNC metal case for ruggedness. It features fully redundant "
"sensors, expanded number of outputs, temperature controlled IMUs, and is the"
" first high performance autopilot with integrated OSD chip."
msgstr ""
"QioTek Zealot F427 是一款内部减震飞控，配有保护性 CNC 金属外壳以提高坚固性。它具有完全冗余传感器、扩展输出数量、温控 "
"IMU，是首款集成 OSD 芯片的高性能飞控。"

