#: ../../source/docs/common-qiotek-zealot.rst:35
#: 13507ad2b28c46d88c1d08ab13787cb8
msgid ""
"5-5.5VDC from USB (internal circuitry and RX only) or via 2 x PowerModule "
"connectors, or via internal BEC off VBAT input pin. All 5V pins are powered "
"when USB, or Power Module(s), or VBAT input is used."
msgstr ""
"通过 USB 供电 5-5.5VDC（仅内部电路和 RX），或通过 2 个电源模块接口，或通过 VBAT 输入引脚上的内部 BEC。使用 "
"USB、电源模块或 VBAT 输入时，所有 5V 引脚均有电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qiotek-zealot.rst:36
#: e536757297f44e33a4202949a1faf20f
msgid ""
"Internal 5V, 1.5A BEC directly can be used with up to 6S LIPO batteries to "
"supply board and peripheral power up to 1.5A max with voltage only "
"monitoring via BATT2 monitor (500ma max recommended)."
msgstr ""
"内部 5V、1.5A BEC 可直接用于最高 6S LiPo 电池，为飞控板和外设供电（最高 1.5A），仅通过 BATT2 "
"监控器进行电压监控（建议最高 500mA）。"

